<title>USA: First Bank to buy U.S. Bancorp - WSJ.</title>
<headline>First Bank to buy U.S. Bancorp - WSJ.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Bank System Inc has agreed to acquire Oregon-based U.S. Bancorp for about $8.8 billion in stock, the Wall Street Journal said in its electronic edition on Thursday.</p>
<p>The boards of both companies were expected to approve the deal and the announcement could come as early as today, the paper said, citing people familiar with the situation.</p>
